# Optional: separate FastAPI origin, without a trailing slash.
# Leave empty on Vercel to use this deployment's public /api routes.
# Local Vite development proxies /api to http://127.0.0.1:8000.
# Never put secrets or internal service binding URLs in VITE_* variables.
VITE_API_URL=
# Featherless keys and model configuration belong only in backend/.env.
